###Request
POST https://testresources.virginatlantic.com/dev/orderdata/svc/orders/search HTTP/1.1

$[?(@.pnr == 'UNPROCESSABLE')]
$[?(@.firstName == 'Jane')]
$[?(@.lastName == 'Doe')]

###Response
HTTP/1.1 422 Unprocessable Entity
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "errors": [
    {
      "code": "ORDER_UNPROCESSABLE",
      "message": "Order document lookup could not be processed."
    }
  ]
}
